{"sha": "b1e0ca5fe941dc578998392a23d3e9a85a45b490f62703fe5324782dd71a41b1", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-4.4,0) -- (4.6,0) node[below, font=\\small] {$x$};", "  \\foreach \\x in {-4,...,4} \\draw (\\x,-0.07) -- (\\x,0.07);", "  \\foreach \\x in {-4,-2,0,2,4}", "    \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,-0.1) {$\\x$};", "  \\draw[omDef, very thick] (-3,0.02) -- (1,0.02);", "  \\fill[omDef] (-3,0.02) circle (2.2pt);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=white, thick] (1,0.02) circle (2.2pt);", "  \\node[omDef, above, font=\\small] at (-1,0.15) {$\\intco{-3}{1}$};", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (2,0.02) -- (4.5,0.02);", "  \\draw[omThm, fill=white, thick] (2,0.02) circle (2.2pt);", "  \\node[omThm, above, font=\\small] at (3.4,0.15) {$\\intoo{2}{+\\infty}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 数轴上的区间：实心点表示包含的端点，", "空心点表示不包含的端点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[交集与并集]\\label{def:g10:numbers:interunion}", "设 $I$ 和 $J$ 为两个实数集合。", "\\emph{交集}\\index{交集} $I \\cap J$（“$I$ 且 $J$”）是", "同时属于两者的数构成的集合；", "\\emph{并集}\\index{并集} $I \\cup J$（“$I$ 或 $J$”）是", "至少属于其中之一的数构成的集合。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g10:numbers:interunion}", "取 $I = \\intcc{-1}{3}$ 与 $J = \\intoo{1}{5}$。在同一条数轴上画出它们，", "两者在 $1$ 与 $3$ 之间有公共部分。由此可得", "\\[", "I \\cap J = \\intoc{1}{3},", "\\qquad", "I \\cup J = \\intco{-1}{5}.", "\\]", "注意括号的选取：$1 \\notin J$，因此 $1 \\notin I \\cap J$；而 $3 \\in I$ 且", "$3 \\in J$，因此 $3 \\in I \\cap J$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[区间的运算]\\label{met:g10:numbers:intervals}", "求两个区间的交集或并集，可按以下步骤进行：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 画出数轴，标出四个端点；", "  \\item 在数轴上方涂出第一个区间，下方涂出第二个区间；", "  \\item 两块阴影重叠之处即为交集，并集则是", "        至少有一块阴影存在之处；", "  \\item 判断每个括号时，检验端点本身是否属于", "        两个集合（求交集时）或至少一个集合（求并集时）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{绝对值与距离}", "", "\\begin{definition}[绝对值]\\label{def:g10:numbers:abs}", "称实数 $x$ 的\\emph{绝对值}\\index{绝对值}为", "\\[", "\\abs{x} =", "\\begin{cases}", "x & \\text{if } x \\geq 0, \\\\", "-x & \\text{if } x < 0.", "\\end{cases}", "\\]", "例如 $\\abs{7} = 7$，$\\abs{-4} = 4$。对任意情形，", "$\\abs{x} \\geq 0$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[数轴上的距离]\\label{prop:g10:numbers:distance}", "对任意实数 $a$ 与 $b$，数轴上点 $a$ 与", "点 $b$ 之间的距离为 $\\abs{b - a}$。特别地，$\\abs{x}$ 是", "$x$ 到 $0$ 的距离。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "若 $b \\geq a$，则 $a$ 到 $b$ 的距离为 $b - a \\geq 0$，它", "等于 $\\abs{b-a}$。若 $b < a$，则距离为 $a - b = -(b - a) > 0$，", "由绝对值的定义，它仍等于 $\\abs{b - a}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[绝对值与区间]\\label{prop:g10:numbers:absinterval}", "设 $a$ 为实数，$r > 0$。则", "\\[", "\\abs{x - a} \\leq r", "\\quad\\text{当且仅当}\\quad", "x \\in \\intcc{a - r}{a + r}.", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\abs{x-a} \\leq r$ 表示 $x$ 到 $a$ 的距离不超过 $r$，", "即 $x$ 在任一侧至多偏离 $r$（以 $a$ 为基准），", "满足此条件的数恰为位于 $a - r$ 与 $a + r$ 之间的数，", "包括两端点。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.1]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.8,0) -- (7,0) node[below, font=\\small] {$x$};", "  \\draw[omDef, very thick] (1.5,0.02) -- (5.5,0.02);", "  \\fill[omDef] (1.5,0.02) circle (2.2pt);", "  \\fill[omDef] (5.5,0.02) circle (2.2pt);", "  \\fill (3.5,0) circle (1.6pt);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (3.5,-0.08) {$a$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.5,-0.08) {$a-r$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (5.5,-0.08) {$a+r$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omThm] (3.5,0.35) -- (5.5,0.35)", "    node[midway, above, font=\\small] {$r$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omThm] (1.5,0.35) -- (3.5,0.35)", "    node[midway, above, font=\\small] {$r$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}